nd-user can select from, and they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are generated from NSStrings in its items array. Once a cell is selected, a checkmark appears next","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to it, similar to Apple’s Settings application where a user selects a Ringtone for their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iPhone. The section can be configured to allow multiple selection and to allow no selection at all.","type":"text"}]}}}